      "POL-NS-05 — false-arrival record: driver DRV-09725 tapped 'I'm Here' at 18:15:10, 120 s before his first qualifying in-geofence fix at 18:17:10, while still on the approach and in motion; record the false marker against the driver so the pattern is visible to POL-NS-07 and to human review (EV-TRIP-02725, EV-GPS-02725)."
